{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00105","headline":"谒慈恩寺题奘法师房 · 高宗皇帝","name":"谒慈恩寺题奘法师房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停轩观福殿，游目眺皇畿。\n法轮含日转，花盖接云飞。\n翠烟香绮阁，丹霞光宝衣。\n幡虹遥合彩，定水迥分晖。\n萧然登十地，自得会三归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}